c-arbint 0.1 (2026-02-07)
=========================

- Initial public release.
- Core signed arbitrary-precision integer operations:
  assignment, comparison, add/sub, multiply, square, and truncated division.
- Binary import/export API and fit-check helpers.
- Runtime/compile-time BMI2 path selection for multiplication on x86 targets.
- Autotools build with shared/static library support, pkg-config metadata,
  manual page, and unit/stochastic tests.
- Optional LTO support via `--enable-lto=auto|yes|no`.
